# Linear mirror configuration. Copy to .env.linear (gitignored). Never commit the real file.
# Create a personal API key in Linear: Settings > Account > Security & access > Personal API keys.
# The key acts as you; a Write-scoped key limited to the mirror team is enough.
LINEAR_API_KEY=lin_api_replace_me
# The team key is the prefix in issue identifiers (e.g. "YERB" in YERB-12). Settings > Teams.
# `npm run linear:sync -- --team KEY` overrides it for one run.
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=YERB
